# uiworks.io

Jekyll + GitHub Pages marketing site. Full maps: `docs/STRUCTURE.md`, `docs/EDITING.md`, `AGENTS.md`.

## Do

- Compose pages with `{% include %}` from `_includes/`
- Put site-wide settings in `_config.yml`; nav in `_data/navigation.yml`
- Style via `_sass/` (`_variables.scss` for brand tokens; `custom.scss` for small overrides)
- Keep Bootstrap / `deneb_*` class patterns and amber theme `#feb000`

## Don't

- Edit `_site/`
- Comment out `header` / `{{ content }}` / `footer` in `_layouts/default.html`
- Migrate away from Jekyll unless explicitly requested
- Touch minified vendor assets unless upgrading them on purpose
